  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mitigating security risks in Lebanon through dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The intervention aims contributing to greater regional stability in the Middle East by mitigating the risk of escalation and tensions in Lebanon. Through capacity building of relevant Lebanese institutions and dialogue with Lebanese stakeholders, the intervention aims to increase Lebanon&#xbf;s negotiation strategy capacity and thereby lay the groundwork for future negotiations on border demarcation, especially in the South.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
